  "review": "One resource frame20 starts DB3FFC; initialization stores resource vtable127094C and empty pImp. Four exits: full destructor DB41C7/DB4F5A, inline counted-pImp release followed by base destructor DB4EB6/DB4EFF. Early termination DB3FF2 skips construction. EDI is zero from DB402C through initial acquisition cancellation to DB4EC6, preserving nonvolatile ABI. Task query DB41AB uses ECX selected by LEA DB41A1 across a conditional branch; CFG tracks that selection. Eight temporary Things: seven health queries/destructors and one distance query with inline cleanup ending DB4147. Full byte regions pin conditional callback/free and weak-handle cleanup. Speech GetHero calls are zero-argument return-reference helpers; animation argument5 remains a live byte load."
